Package: luddo-game
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Luddo Game Developer <developer@luddo-game.com>
Homepage: https://luddo-game.com
Description: Luddo Game - A classic multiplayer board game application
 Luddo Game is an interactive digital implementation of the traditional
 Luddo board game. Play with friends and family online or locally.
 
Features:
 - Single player and multiplayer modes
 - Real-time online gameplay
 - Offline play capability
 - Customizable game rules
 - Chat and social features
 - Cross-platform support
 - Smooth animations and graphics
 - User-friendly interface

Depends: nodejs (>= 14.0), npm (>= 6.0)
Recommends: libgl1-mesa-glx
Suggests: luddo-game-themes

Priority: optional
Section: games
